rk spots and patches rather than detailed rendering, the neckline curving low across her chest. A thin gold necklace with a small round pendant hangs at her collarbone, drawn as a fine single line with a tiny circle at its centre. On the right side of the frame, roughly at mid-height, a small black serif label reads \"NO. 01\" with a thin horizontal rule drawn directly beneath it. Below that, in the lower-right area, three short lines of small black serif type read \"Some faces\" \"carry\" \"silent stories.\" stacked vertically with generous leading. The lighting is flat and even across the entire composition, with no cast shadows or highlights, consistent with a hand-drawn illustration on a paper surface where all depth comes from line weight and stroke density rather than light direction. The overall composition is balanced and minimalist, with the dense dark charcoal mass of the figure anchoring the centre while the sparse text elements float in the negative space on either side, creating a quiet, contemplative mood on a restrained palette of black ink on cream paper.", "", 1024], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 789, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images.image_1", "link": 746, "label": "参考图 1 (Image-1)", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "参考图 1 (Image-1)"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "link": 747, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 769, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "negative_prompt"}, "name": "negative_prompt", "label": "negative_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "negative_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "name": "resolution", "label": "resolution", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "resolution"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images.image_9", "label": "参考图 2 (Image-2)", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "参考图 2 (Image-2)"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images.image_1